{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果在人工智能硬件領域的佈局正逐漸從傳聞走向現實。近日，一家長期合作供應商公開確認，其正在參與蘋果下一代人工智能可穿戴產品項目，包括備受關注的AI智能眼鏡以及配備攝像頭的AirPods產品線，這也是蘋果未來AI硬件戰略獲得的重要外部佐證之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585970.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:59:54.412843+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:50:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:14.097811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:14.097811+00:00","content_hash":"8c72e87058073b8f4b59187f39afd68d3a39da2320e14622c51d67fdea58eafb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}